// BT-4252: superclass of Bt4252ClassProtocolActorChild. Its class methods
// send Behaviour-protocol selectors to `self`/`super`; inherited by the
// child, they answer for the receiving subclass.

Actor subclass: Bt4252ClassProtocolActorBase

  class inheritedSelfName => self name

  class inheritedSuperName => super name
